    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Explaining a need and asking for clarification",
     "texto": [
      "State the symptom briefly: **Jeg har hoste** («I have a cough») or **Jeg har vondt i hodet** («I have a headache»). To ask for help: **Kan du forklare doseringen på pakningen?**. Don't work out the dose yourself; check the product's instructions and ask qualified staff.",
      "**Hvor mange ganger om dagen?** asks how many times a day. Amounts and restrictions vary by product and by person; the conversation is for practising Norwegian, not for choosing a treatment."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
